# =============================================================================
# FILE: requirements-dev.in
# PURPOSE: Source file for development dependencies
# Recommended Workflow
#    During development: Edit requirements.in and run pip-compile to update the lock file.
#    During installation:
#        If ENVIRONMENT=production → install from requirements-lock.txt
#        If ENVIRONMENT=development → install from requirements.txt
#    Before release: Run pip-compile requirements.in -o requirements-lock.txt and commit the lock file.
#
# requirements.in → requirements-lock.txt → Used for production installation (pinned versions)
# requirements-dev.txt → Used for development (loose versions)
# src/core/requirements.txt → Used by Docker build (LangGraph container)    
#
# =============================================================================

